Error [E0377]: `#Known` is retired
  --> tests/ui/comptime_known_block_retired.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     #Known {
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: Compile time has one mark, `@`, and the mark belongs to the name, so it is written at every mention
 Fix: Write `@ { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0377

Error [E0377]: `#Known` is retired
  --> tests/ui/comptime_known_block_retired.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     #Known if true {
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: Compile time has one mark, `@`, and the mark belongs to the name, so it is written at every mention
 Fix: Write `@if <condition> { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0377
